      "content": "But he's so sleepy, I dont think he'll even drink the juice. If I just try to force him to take some Pedialyte or juice every 15 mins for the next hour, do you think he'll bounce back? I'm really trying to avoid the ER if I can because it's so expensive and stressful for him. Is there any way I can tell if he's actually getting better at home?",
